      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLIFFORD.\nPlantagenet! I come, Plantagenet!\nAnd this thy son’s blood cleaving to my blade\nShall rust upon my weapon till thy blood,\nCongealed with this, do make me wipe off both.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
